===Cladograms===
The following cladograms show two possible placements of ''Ooedigera''.  First, on the left, a monophyletic Vetulicolia is shown as the sister group to [[Tunicata]], but with all internal relationships unresolved.<ref>{{harvnb|García-Bellido|Lee|Edgecombe|Jago|2014|page=9}}</ref>  Next, on the right, ''Ooedigira'' is recovered as the most [[basal (phylogenetics)|basal]] member of a monophyletic Vetulicolidae<ref>{{harvnb|Li|Williams|Gabbott|Chen|2018|pages=1083–1084}} {{small|This definition of Vetulicolidae is used to label the node on the Mussini ''et al.'' 2024 cladogram</ref> within a paraphyletic vetulicolian grade of stem chordates.<ref name=MussiniCladogram>{{harvnb|Mussini|Smith|Vinther|Rahman|2024|pages=6–7}}</ref> 

